operation-linked CI-less floor per operator constraint; submits held until resume). 1728/1729 hamadryas pair (LLM+1, CI running). Lamprey implementing (claim exit 0 at a147945aae).\n\nOPERATOR-DIRECTIVE TICKETS QUEUED: pittabird (double bridge+canary cadence), rasbora (portability = diverse-or-no CI providers), springtail (flaky tests get debugged not retried) — all with the operator-batch agent, paused.\n\nRESUME ACTIONS (~11:03am PT cron): resume all five agents; sweep Gerrit for READY (expect 1717/1727/1728/1729); marabou close; then continue lanes. Pending operator decisions unchanged: P3.0 blocking-lane re-enable; CV architecture re-commission; Live External Integration re-green; graywolf live-Jira dispatch."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786621966471432001,"uuid":"2285493a-839c-4ee0-bc9b-87cffbaae7e4"}